{"4320330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Maze 95 Ultimate", "steam_appid": 4320330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320330/extras/853ab3cbb98107ae93bb03263b407d15.poster.avif?t=1786457513\" width=1170 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320330/extras/853ab3cbb98107ae93bb03263b407d15.webm?t=1786457513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320330/extras/853ab3cbb98107ae93bb03263b407d15.mp4?t=1786457513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Maze is Back!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The maze you remember has been rebuilt from scratch. Return to the classic screensaver era, supercharged with new features for your enjoyment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320330/extras/8950f3ee895b039c0302bef7f2d9f3cf.poster.avif?t=1786457513\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320330/extras/8950f3ee895b039c0302bef7f2d9f3cf.webm?t=1786457513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320330/extras/8950f3ee895b039c0302bef7f2d9f3cf.mp4?t=1786457513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch It, or Play It</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto Mode:</strong> Sit back and let it run. Zone out like it's 1997. Features an adjustable camera speed and other maze options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Mode:</strong> Take the wheel and navigate the maze yourself. No more wondering what's around the corner. Collect coins to level up and move faster!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Bonus Game Modes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horror Mode:</strong> Find your way out in the dark while avoiding the giant rat. Use your firecrackers to illuminate the spooky halls and scare away the rat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rodent Rumble:</strong> Vacuum up as many rats as you can, build up a combo multiplier, and sell them before the timer runs out. Buy upgrades with each level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320330/extras/394c374c785f591514f35582de93d243.poster.avif?t=1786457513\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320330/extras/394c374c785f591514f35582de93d243.webm?t=1786457513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320330/extras/394c374c785f591514f35582de93d243.mp4?t=1786457513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Global Leaderboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for the fastest solve time on every maze size and horror mode, and the highest score for rodent rumble mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weekly Competitive Leaderboards:</strong> Everyone gets the same seed for each game mode, see how high you can get on the leaderboards every week with a new equal playing field.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Maze, Your Rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap the textures or upload your own images: your pets, memes, favorite photos, whatever you want on those walls. Load your own music to create your own playlist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust the maze generation algorithm, change the size, crank the rat population.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Steam Workshop 🎨</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the community and share your custom texture packs for the maze! Easily browse and install any texture packs you like from the workshop page.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the classic screensaver era</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto Mode (screensaver), Play Mode (you control it), Horror Mode (beware of the giant rat), and Rodent Rumble (vacuum up the rats)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro CRT mode and bonus special effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global leaderboards for every maze size, Horror Mode, and Rodent Rumble</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full texture customization with custom image loading</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five maze generation algorithms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five maze sizes (6x6, 10x10, 16x16, 24x24, 36x36)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable rat population</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load your own music into the playlist</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Soundtrack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Songs from <i>Pangeapedia Plus</i> by <strong>Daniel White</strong> are included in the game.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320330/extras/853ab3cbb98107ae93bb03263b407d15.poster.avif?t=1786457513\" width=1170 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320330/extras/853ab3cbb98107ae93bb03263b407d15.webm?t=1786457513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320330/extras/853ab3cbb98107ae93bb03263b407d15.mp4?t=1786457513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Maze is Back!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The maze you remember has been rebuilt from scratch. Return to the classic screensaver era, supercharged with new features for your enjoyment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320330/extras/8950f3ee895b039c0302bef7f2d9f3cf.poster.avif?t=1786457513\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320330/extras/8950f3ee895b039c0302bef7f2d9f3cf.webm?t=1786457513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320330/extras/8950f3ee895b039c0302bef7f2d9f3cf.mp4?t=1786457513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch It, or Play It</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto Mode:</strong> Sit back and let it run. Zone out like it's 1997. Features an adjustable camera speed and other maze options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Mode:</strong> Take the wheel and navigate the maze yourself. No more wondering what's around the corner. Collect coins to level up and move faster!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Bonus Game Modes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horror Mode:</strong> Find your way out in the dark while avoiding the giant rat. Use your firecrackers to illuminate the spooky halls and scare away the rat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rodent Rumble:</strong> Vacuum up as many rats as you can, build up a combo multiplier, and sell them before the timer runs out. Buy upgrades with each level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320330/extras/394c374c785f591514f35582de93d243.poster.avif?t=1786457513\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320330/extras/3