><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable rat population</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load your own music into the playlist</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Soundtrack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Songs from <i>Pangeapedia Plus</i> by <strong>Daniel White</strong> are included in the game.</p>", "short_description": "The maze that hypnotized a generation is back. It was a screensaver. But now? You can finally walk those halls yourself. Or just relax and watch, like the old times. Share your custom texture packs in the Steam Workshop.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320330/0e61e905bcdb2ea3e275710a9c137e3b241ca5df/header.jpg?t=1786457513", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320330/dc4c242a396ba8c2f4753dfe075372926c955b59/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786457513", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320330/dc4c242a396ba8c2f4753dfe075372926c955b59/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786457513", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}